":"Stephen Yang","x":"Simultaneously, we are expanding the use of AI to streamline internal operations, thereby boosting efficiency and elevating the support for our teachers and staff.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/04/22/new-oriental-edu-q3-2026-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"EDU 2026 Q3","e":"edu","d":"2026-04-22","l":"guidance","r":"analyst","s":"Stephen Yang","x":"New Oriental Education & Technology Group Inc. raises the full-year guidance of total net revenue in fiscal year 2026, 06/01/2025 to 05/31/2026, to be in the range of $5.5614 billion to $5.5987 billion, representing a year-over-year increase in the range of 13% to 14%.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/04/22/new-oriental-edu-q3-2026-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"EDU 2026 Q4","e":"edu","d":"2026-07-29","l":"streaming","r":"analyst","s":"Zhihui Yang","x":"On the platform front, East Buy made significant strides in its multi-platform live streaming strategy on Douyin, launching 11 new vertical live streaming accounts and expanding its channel matrix to 18 channels in total.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/08/07/new-oriental-edu-q4-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"EDU 2026 Q4","e":"edu","d":"2026-07-29","l":"streaming","r":"analyst","s":"Zhihui Yang","x":"East Buy also launched a suite of the innovative operational programs, including streamer recruitment campaigns and annual suppliers that has proven effective to strengthen internal operational teams, deepen long-term strategic partnerships with suppliers and elevate the customer engagement.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/08/07/new-oriental-edu-q4-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"EDU 2026 Q4","e":"edu","d":"2026-07-29","l":"cost_cuts","r":"analyst","s":"Zhihui Yang","x":"In the coming quarter, we expect meaningful cost improvement to emerge from the restructuring of our overseas business, which will pave the way for the greater operati